This integration package enables integration between SAP Subscription Billing (SB) and SAP Entitlement Management (EMS).
The integration scope includes replication of customers and products from SAP Subscription Billing to SAP Entitlement Management. Creation of entitlements in SAP Entitlement Management based on subscriptions in SAP Subscription Billing.
&nbsp;

The SAP Commerce Cloud Integration with SAP Field Service Management package enables integration of Service Scenarios between SAP Commerce front office and SAP Field Service management.
This package works in conjunction with "SAP Commerce Cloud Integration with SAP S/4HANA Cloud - Service" package and "SAP S/4HANA Cloud Integration with SAP Field Service Management".
The scope of this package includes replication of skills, service order creation, and service order update.
