This package contains editable sub-flows for customer extension of SAP S/4HANA Integration with SAP Fieldglass. 
These sub-flows can be called from the the main flows in the configure only "SAP S/4HANA Integration with SAP Fieldglass" package. They have the basic mapping ready for extending with custom logic as well as options for extended WSDLs.&nbsp; 
Available: 

 Purchase Requisition 
 Purchase Order 
 Service Entry Sheet 
 Invoice 

