Integrate and automate the operations of your SAP Concur Solution with your SAP Financial system (Currently SAP ERP, SAP S/4HANA on Premise as of version 1511 or above and&nbsp; SAP S/4HANA Cloud are supported). This is a pass through scenario. It should be used in case you want to connect your SAP financial system with your SAP Concur Solution via Cloud Platform Integration.
The configuration of the integration is performed in the SAP financial system. In the SAP ERP it can be started using transaction CTE_SETUP. In SAP S/4HANA Cloud use the “Concur Integration Setup” App.
&nbsp;

