This integration package helps acquire business events from SAP S/4 HANA and SAP S/4HANA Cloud &amp; pushing them to SAP Process Visibility service. 
It enables you to: 

 read business events along with context data from SAP S/4HANA and SAP S/4HANA Cloud 
 transform the events to the required format 
 push these events to SAP Process Visibility service 

This helps gain end to end visibility on your processes involving Business Objects from SAP S/4HANA or SAP S/4HANA Cloud. 
&nbsp; 
&nbsp; 
&nbsp;

With this integration scenario you can manage Currency Exchange Rate data and replicate the data to Employee Central by using Filters in the Replication Model. The filters can be chosen in S/4HANA Cloud for various parameters of a currency exchange rate. After replication, the currency exchange rate data in SFSF Employee Central can be viewed in relation to payment purposes.
